    "answer": {
      "short": "$(x-6y)(x+y)$",
      "worked": "The cross terms are $-6xy+xy=-5xy$, and $(-6y)y=-6y^2$.\n$$x^2-5xy-6y^2=(x-6y)(x+y).$$",
